{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/pulls/645","id":5096310221,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUbzce88AAAABL8OFzQ","html_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/645","diff_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/645.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/645.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/issues/645","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/pulls/645/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/pulls/645/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/issues/645/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rinsakamo/relay-self/statuses/e6d901d7dc3effb5c7516350233383fbb982bbb1","number":645,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"S50 DEV: source-bound Paper movement × client controls handoff for SelfBody (no Present promotion)","user":{"login":"rinsakamo","id":272078660,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDeXRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272078660?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo","html_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Purpose / owner\nS-owned source-only handoff to [SelfBody #632](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/issues/632), stacked **on S50 source owner Draft #642 branch**. Existing [SelfBody Draft #634](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/634), [L23 Draft #641](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/641), [successful packet diagnostic Draft #643](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/643), main, M/P1/L8 and protected originals remain unchanged. No new Action/Motor/STOP/clear owner or packet emitter.\n\n## Implementation\n- Immutable `S50SelfBodyMotionSource` (NOT `BodyObservation`): per-Paper-World-tick sampled displacement and server-last-reported input, plus original client-local set/clear control snapshots in **Node record order only**. Explicit unrelated clock domains and source SHA/marker/World/player IDs. Flags off + nonzero motion are preserved as a diagnostic instead of treating them as physically stopped. Byte-limited original source parsing; schema/identity/fulltime/sample continuity, duplicate/mismatch/NaN/overflow and client loss fail closed.\n- Reuses existing S owner `review_s50_input_samples` and `inspect_s50_client_packets`. The copied L23 readback claim must match Paper original SHA and source refs, but this is **not** independent TCP authentication or SelfBody native Present admission.\n- Standalone read-only CLI `tools/s50_selfbody_motion_readback.py` consumes a closed S49/L23 one-Action DEV report plus Paper/client originals and writes only a new, diagnostic JSON. Negative-control tests and focused CI added.\n- [Source handoff/readback instructions](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/blob/dev/s50-selfbody-physical-observation-20261031/docs/s50-selfbody-physical-motion-handoff-20261031.md) for replaying the preserved real [#643 evidence](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/tree/2afb7250952ae490bcddc8244c19264ff1f73bf5/docs/evidence/s50-client-packet-20261031/run2) without starting a new World.\n\n## Evidence ceiling\nThe previous real World recorded Paper position changes at ticks 251/252 despite last-reported input all OFF; Node client `back` on → clear all OFF, position writes23 and `player_input` 0, but source clocks are different. **This PR does not run a new World and does not independently re-attest prior physical originals.** Even eight zero sampled displacements cannot prove complete idle, effective S15 clear, Goal, P1 WAIT, L10 or SCIENCE. The diagnostic is not automatically wired into `SelfBodyView`; its owner #632 decides how to consume it.\n\nDEV_ONLY / SOURCE_CANDIDATE_ONLY / PHYSICAL_STABILITY_UNPROVEN / GOAL_UNDETERMINED / P1_WAIT_0 / L10_0 / QUALIFICATION_NO_GO / SCIENCE_NOT_RUN.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-31T09:26:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T10:50:14Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c3d92c11f93890467475c1f7e0164b9cf14dad05","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"rinsakamo:dev/s50-selfbody-physical-observation-20261031","ref":"dev/s50-selfbody-physical-observation-20261031","repo":{"id":1371331707,"node_id":"R_kgDOUbzcew","name":"relay-self","full_name":"rinsakamo/relay-self","owner":{"login":"rinsakamo","id":272078660,"node_id":"U_kgDOEDeXRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/272078660?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo","html_url":"https://github.com/rinsakamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rinsakamo